{"version":1,"key":"card:292","content":{"id":292,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"peerDependencies","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 是 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"package.json","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的一个属性，类似于 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"dependencies","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"devDependices","code":true},{"text":"，不同于点在于 ","type":"formatted"},{"type":"formatted","text":"peerDependencies","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 一般常见于库中，用来声明该库所依赖的一些包的版本，但是不希望将其打包，而是由使用该包的项目进行下载。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"比如开发了一个 React 组件库，那肯定是依赖 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"react","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"react-dom","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 的，但是出于体积的考虑，不希望将二者打包，就会在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"peerDependencies","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中进行声明，在使用该库的项目中下载，由于这是一个 React 组件库，使用该组件库就一定会下载 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"react","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 和 react-dom 的，因此是合理的。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"note","title":"","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"包管理工具不会主动下载 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"peerDependencies","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 所声明的包，需要手动下载。"}],"disableDrag":false}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"下面是 Ant Design 在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"package.json","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中的"},{"type":"link","url":"https://github.com/ant-design/ant-design/blob/master/package.json","openEdit":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"声明"}]},{"text":"","type":"formatted"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":"{\n  \"peerDependencies\": {\n    \"react\": \">=16.9.0\",\n    \"react-dom\": \">=16.9.0\"\n  }\n}","language":"JSON","uuid":"c3286aa9-821f-4b7c-a3ed-fda98bc6d624","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在 "},{"type":"formatted","text":"peerDependencies","code":true},{"type":"formatted","text":" 中规定了所依赖库的版本，但是使用该包的项目未下载所声明的包或下载的包不满足版本要求，则会在控制台中打印警告信息"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"code-block","code":" WARN  Issues with peer dependencies found\n.\n├─┬ @babel/plugin-syntax-unicode-sets-regex 7.18.6\n│   └── ✕ missing peer webpack@^5.20.0\n├─┬ mermaid 10.1.0\n│ └─┬ @khanacademy/simple-markdown 0.8.6\n│   ├── ✕ unmet peer react@16.14.0: found 18.2.0\n│   └── ✕ unmet peer react-dom@16.14.0: found 18.2.0\n└─┬ react-codemirror2 7.2.1\n  └── ✕ unmet peer react@\">=15.5 <=16.x\": found 18.2.0\nPeer dependencies that should be installed:\n  @babel/core@\">=7.0.0 <8.0.0\"  unist-util-visit@^2.0.0       webpack@^5.20.0","language":"text","uuid":"5ae03f0c-02d6-4391-8dbc-3e9d751b341d","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]}],"tags":["包管理器/package.json"],"createTime":1692191637521,"updateTime":1745400262963,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1745400262963}}